## Boundary And Approval Limits

OFF_WINDOW_NOT_OBSERVED applies to intentionally hidden horizontal-scroll content, shafts entering through a media edge, upper/lower figure continuations, boundary prose fragments, the bottom button continuation and the mostly hidden neighboring grid in 390-text-0048.png. These are neither internal display defects nor approval of invisible tails. Source rectangles remain exactly as assigned, including fractional coordinates.

No true in-window glyph cut, unintended label collision, blank/error media or other internal display blocker was observed. Visible line intersections and multiple shafts meeting a dot do not cover the adjacent numerals. PASS is not a mathematical, source-fidelity, answer, figure-semantic or full-figure verdict.

